  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-kanban · Task board for DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "A DeepSeek Harness plugin that brings the full **Hermes kanban board** (Nous\nResearch, MIT) into DSH: the complete board engine and UI run as a local\nsidecar, while DSH adds web-server integration, model tools, and a\n**DSH-native dispatcher** that executes cards with `dsh --profile headless`\nworkers."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-kanban · Task board for DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "> Hermes parity: 9-column board, multiple boards, comments / attachments /\n> links / event timeline, run records, diagnostics with recovery actions,\n> claim locks + circuit breaker, live updates over WebSocket."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **9 columns**: triage / todo / scheduled / ready / running / blocked / review / done / archived — drag & drop, multi-select bulk actions\n- **Full cards**: body, assignee, priority, parent/child dependencies, tenant, workspace, model overrides, goal mode\n- **Card drawer**: comments, attachments, links, events, runs, diagnostics (with one-click recovery actions), worker logs\n- **Multiple boards**: one SQLite (WAL) per board, created/switched from the UI\n- **Model tools**: `kanban_board` / `kanban_task_create` / `kanban_task_get` / `kanban_task_update` / `kanban_task_comment` / `kanban_task_link` / `kanban_task_unlink` / `kanban_task_delete` / `kanban_dispatch`\n- **DSH-native dispatcher**: claims ready cards and runs `dsh --profile headless` workers; claim locks, heartbeats, crash reclaim, consecutive-failure circuit breaker, max concurrency\n- **Live updates**: `/events` WebSocket stream"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile <name> add github:FuncWei/dsh-kanban\n```\n\nThe sidecar auto-boots on first use (`uv` preferred; falls back to\n`python3 -m venv`). Restart `dsh web`, then open:\n\n- Board UI: `http://127.0.0.1:3080/kanban` (or the sidebar “任务看板” button)\n- Data dir: `<DSH_HOME>/storages/kanban/` (default `~/.dsh/storages/kanban/`)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration (env vars)",
      "text": "| Var | Default | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| `DSH_KANBAN_WORKER_CMD` | `dsh --profile headless` | Worker launch command |\n| `DSH_KANBAN_MAX_WORKERS` | `4` | Global concurrent-worker cap |\n| `DSH_KANBAN_PYTHON` | auto (uv, then python3) | Sidecar Python interpreter |\n| `DSH_KANBAN_ROOT` | `<DSH_HOME>/storages/kanban` | Board data directory |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "```\nDSH web server\n ├─ /kanban                  → board UI (Hermes frontend + SDK shim)\n ├─ /api/plugins/kanban/*    → REST proxy (Hermes plugin_api)\n ├─ /api/plugins/kanban/events → WebSocket proxy (live events)"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT. The sidecar reuses the kanban implementation from Hermes Agent by Nous\nResearch (MIT) — see `NOTICE.md`."
    }
  ],
